It is night now.
I am standing in the bedroom.
I turn off the main lights.
Only one small light is shining.
I lie down on the bed.
I take my lightweight blanket.
I am resting under the blanket.
I am reading a new book.
This is a new novel.
The story is very interesting.
But, my eyes are feeling heavy.
I am getting sleepy.
I stop reading.
I am putting the book down.
I turn off that small light too.
It is very dark in the room now.
I am closing my eyes.
I am falling asleep quickly.
Tomorrow is a new day.
Good night.
